    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in trying to fix it. like, why bother fighting for a life that's just this much work? everything is so heavy. sometimes i just think about what it would be like if everything just... stopped. the noise, the struggle, all of it. it sounds so peaceful.",
